WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.720
A physio clinic receives reviews
on Google.

2
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.540
Rosalia answers the four- and
five-star ones.

3
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:12.050
A one-star review comes in.
Patricia doesn't know what she is doing.

4
00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:16.790
Rosalia asks Patrick on WhatsApp
what he wants to answer.

5
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.500
He writes the reply, she suggests
one more line.

6
00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.070
He says go ahead, she publishes it
on Google.
